#~ "That was many years ago, I’m afraid. Now, we really must be moving "
#~ "along ..."
#~ msgstr "恐怕那已经是很多年以前的事了。现在，我们真的得走了……"

#~ msgid "So hasty ... hmm ... there was something ..."
#~ msgstr "这么急……呣……还有件事儿……"

#~ msgid "Book?"
#~ msgstr "书？"

